lculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids August to September, September to October and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years. In 2025 the middle ran 162% of normal in April to May and 63% in September to October. So far in 2026 the middle sat at 43% in January to February and 44% in February to March, then reached 145% in June to July.</p>"}
